\ wproof.fam — payment proofs and proofs of burn (docs/PROOFS.md,
\ docs/GUI_WALLET.md phase 2), as tabminer's miner/src/proofs.rs: that an
\ output was made in a block, by its path to that block's state root, and
\ whose it is: a payment's receipt (the recipient's Dilithium signature of
\ the output, the slate and the sender), or a burn's preimage (its
\ beneficiary, nonce and purpose, whose hash is the memo).  After wkeys.fam
\ and wslate.fam, with crypto/dilithium.fam loaded first.  Amounts and
\ positions are 8 bytes, little-endian, passed by address.
\
\ A proof's bytes: its format (1 a payment, 2 a burn), the height (4), the
\ position (8), the key hash (32), the amount (8), the memo (20), the path
\ (40 siblings of 32, the leaf's first); a payment's then its sender (0
\ and the sender's address, 32, or 1 and the unnamed sender's secret,
\ 32), the slate's id (32), the receipt's key (1,952) and signature
\ (3,309); a burn's its beneficiary (32), nonce (32), the purpose's length
\ (1) and purpose.  As text: base64 between "-----BEGIN TAB PAYMENT
\ PROOF-----" (or BURN) and its END line, 64 characters a line.
\
\ wpinit  the buffers (once).
\ wpparse ( a n -- flag )  a proof decoded (Proof::from_bytes's rules):
\ wpa, wpn, wpfmt.
\ wpchk ( root -- code )  the parsed proof checked against a block's state
\ root (32 canonical bytes): 0 it holds, 1 the output is not in that
\ block's state, 2 the receipt does not hold, 3 not that burn.
\ wpleaf ( c -- )  c (8 Montgomery words) = its output's leaf.
\ wphdr ( fmt height pos keyhash amt memo -- )  a proof begun at wpb;
\ wppath ( path -- ) its 1,280 bytes of siblings; then wppay ( kind
\ sender slateid rkey rsig -- n ), kind 0 the sender's address, 1 its
\ secret, or wpburn ( ben nonce purpose plen -- n ): its length.
\ wpbmemo ( ben nonce purpose plen dst -- )  a burn's memo (20 canonical
\ bytes) at dst.
\ wptext ( a n dst -- n' )  a proof's text (its marker by its format).
\ wpfrom ( text dst -- n | -1 )  a proof's bytes from text holding one
\ between its markers, whatever surrounds it (the format the marker's).

: wpa variable ;  : wpn variable ;  : wpfmt variable ;  : wpb variable ;  : wpbn variable ;  : wpt variable ;
: wpd1 variable ;  : wpd2 variable ;  : wpm variable ;  : wps variable ;  : wplo variable ;  : wphi variable ;
: wpok variable ;  : wpr variable ;
:M WPCL 549 lit ;                             \ where the claim begins
: wpinit
wsinit
wpb @ 0= if 2000 lit alloc wpb !  400 lit alloc wpt !  20 lit alloc wpd1 !  20 lit alloc wpd2 !  80 lit alloc wpm !
	200 lit alloc wps !  20 lit alloc wpr ! then ;

\ wpparse: lengths, then each element canonical.
: wpparse
wpn !  wpa !  -1 lit wpok !
wpn @ WPCL 1 lit + u< if 0 lit wpok ! then
wpok @ if
	wpa @ c@ dup wpfmt !  1 lit - 2 lit u< wpok @ and wpok !
	wpa @ D lit + 8 lit wscanw  wpa @ 35 lit + 5 lit wscanw and  wpa @ 49 lit + 140 lit wscanw and  wpok @ and wpok !
then
wpok @ if
	wpfmt @ 1 lit = if
		wpa @ WPCL + c@ dup 1 lit u> if drop 0 lit wpok ! else
			0= if wpa @ WPCL + 1 lit + 8 lit wscanw wpok @ and wpok ! then
		then
		wpn @ 1A17 lit = wpok @ and wpok !
	else
		wpn @ WPCL 41 lit + u< if 0 lit wpok ! else
			wpa @ WPCL + 8 lit wscanw wpok @ and wpok !
			wpa @ WPCL + 40 lit + c@ WPCL + 41 lit + wpn @ = wpok @ and wpok !
		then
	then
then
wpok @ ;

\ wpleaf: compress(compress(commitment, slot), height): the slot the
\ memo's five words and the amount's three limbs.
: wpleaf
wpr !
wpa @ D lit + wpd1 @ wsocom
5 lit 0 lit do wpa @ 35 lit + i 2 lit lshift + le@ tom wpt @ i w! loop
wpt @ 14 lit + vp !  wpa @ 2D lit + vamount
wpd1 @ wpt @ wpd2 @ compress
wpt @ 8 lit wzero  wpa @ 1 lit + le@ tom wpt @ !
wpd2 @ wpt @ wpr @ compress ;
\ wpwalk ( c -- )  c, the leaf, walked up the path to the root its
\ position's bits say: the sibling on the left where a bit is 1.
: wpwalk
wpr !
wpa @ 5 lit + le@ wplo !  wpa @ 9 lit + le@ wphi !
28 lit 0 lit do
	wpa @ 49 lit + i 5 lit lshift + wpt @ dle
	wplo @ 1 lit and if wpt @ wpr @ wpr @ compress else wpr @ wpt @ wpr @ compress then
	wplo @ 1 lit rshift wphi @ 1F lit lshift or wplo !  wphi @ 1 lit rshift wphi !
loop ;
\ wpsend ( -- a )  the sender the receipt names (32 canonical bytes): the
\ address, or the unnamed sender's secret's tag.
: wpsend
wpa @ WPCL + c@ if wpa @ WPCL + 1 lit + wpd2 @ wstag  wpd2 @ wps @ wkcan  wps @ else wpa @ WPCL + 1 lit + then ;
\ wpbmemo: hash_domain 22 of the beneficiary, the nonce and the purpose,
\ three bytes an element; its first five elements.
: wpben variable ;  : wpnon variable ;  : wppur variable ;  : wpln variable ;  : wpdst variable ;
: wpbmemo
wpdst !  wpln !  wppur !  wpnon !  wpben !
wpben @ wps @ 20 lit bcopy  wpnon @ wps @ 20 lit + 20 lit bcopy  wppur @ wps @ 40 lit + wpln @ bcopy
wps @ 40 lit wpln @ + wkpack  wkb @ swap 16 lit wpd2 @ hdom
wpd2 @ wpt @ wkcan  wpt @ wpdst @ 14 lit bcopy ;
: wpchk
wpd1 @ dle  wpd1 @ wpm @ 8 lit wcopy
wpr @ wpleaf  wpr @ wpwalk
wpa @ 9 lit + le@ 100 lit u<  wpr @ wpm @ d= and 0= if 1 lit else
	wpfmt @ 1 lit = if
		\ the receipt's message: the commitment, amount, memo, slate id, sender
		wpa @ D lit + wpd1 @ wsocom  wpd1 @ wpm @ wkcan
		wpa @ 2D lit + wpm @ 20 lit + 8 lit bcopy  wpa @ 35 lit + wpm @ 28 lit + 14 lit bcopy
		wpa @ WPCL + 21 lit + wpm @ 3C lit + 20 lit bcopy  wpsend wpm @ 5C lit + 20 lit bcopy
		wpa @ WPCL + 41 lit + wpm @ 7C lit "tab-receipt" B lit wpa @ WPCL + 41 lit + 7A0 lit + dilver
		if 0 lit else 2 lit then
	else
		wpa @ WPCL + wpa @ WPCL + 20 lit + wpa @ WPCL + 41 lit + wpa @ WPCL + 40 lit + c@ wpm @ wpbmemo
		-1 lit 20 lit 0 lit do wpa @ D lit + i + c@ 0= and loop
		wpm @ wpa @ 35 lit + 14 lit wssame and if 0 lit else 3 lit then
	then
then ;

\ Building, at wpb.
: wpf variable ;  : wph variable ;  : wpps variable ;  : wpkh variable ;  : wpam variable ;  : wpmm variable ;
: wphdr
wpmm !  wpam !  wpkh !  wpps !  wph !  wpf !
wpf @ wpb @ c!  wph @ wpb @ 1 lit + wkle!  wpps @ wpb @ 5 lit + 8 lit bcopy  wpkh @ wpb @ D lit + 20 lit bcopy
wpam @ wpb @ 2D lit + 8 lit bcopy  wpmm @ wpb @ 35 lit + 14 lit bcopy  49 lit wpbn ! ;
: wppath  wpb @ 49 lit + 500 lit bcopy  WPCL wpbn ! ;
: wpkd variable ;  : wpsd variable ;  : wpsl variable ;  : wprk variable ;  : wprs variable ;
: wppay
wprs !  wprk !  wpsl !  wpsd !  wpkd !
wpkd @ wpb @ WPCL + c!  wpsd @ wpb @ WPCL + 1 lit + 20 lit bcopy  wpsl @ wpb @ WPCL + 21 lit + 20 lit bcopy
wprk @ wpb @ WPCL + 41 lit + 7A0 lit bcopy  wprs @ wpb @ WPCL + 41 lit + 7A0 lit + CED lit bcopy
1A17 lit dup wpbn ! ;
: wpburn
wpln !  wppur !  wpnon !  wpben !
wpben @ wpb @ WPCL + 20 lit bcopy  wpnon @ wpb @ WPCL + 20 lit + 20 lit bcopy
wpln @ wpb @ WPCL + 40 lit + c!  wppur @ wpb @ WPCL + 41 lit + wpln @ bcopy
WPCL 41 lit + wpln @ + dup wpbn ! ;

\ Text: base64, 64 characters a line, between the format's markers.
: wpq variable ;  : wpc variable ;  : wpv variable ;  : wpi variable ;  : wpz variable ;  : wpx variable ;  : wpy variable ;
: wpput  wpq @ c!  wpq @ 1 lit + wpq ! ;                 \ ( c -- )
: wpstr  begin dup c@ ?dup while wpput 1 lit + repeat drop ;   \ ( s -- )
: wpmark  wpz @ 1 lit = if "TAB PAYMENT PROOF" else "TAB BURN PROOF" then ;
: wp64c  "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789+/" + c@ ;   \ ( v -- c )
: wpch  wpput  wpc @ 1 lit + dup wpc !  40 lit = if A lit wpput  0 lit wpc ! then ;
: wptext
wpq !  wpn !  wpa !  wpq @ wpx !  wpa @ c@ wpz !  0 lit wpc !
"-----BEGIN " wpstr wpmark wpstr "-----" wpstr A lit wpput
wpn @ 2 lit + 3 lit / ?dup if 0 lit do
	wpn @ i 3 lit * - 3 lit umin wpi !
	wpa @ i 3 lit * + wpy !
	wpy @ c@ 10 lit lshift
	wpi @ 1 lit u> if wpy @ 1 lit + c@ 8 lit lshift or then
	wpi @ 2 lit u> if wpy @ 2 lit + c@ or then
	wpv !
	4 lit 0 lit do
		i wpi @ u> if 3D lit wpch else wpv @ 12 lit i 6 lit * - rshift 3F lit and wp64c wpch then
	loop
loop then
wpc @ if A lit wpput then
"-----END " wpstr wpmark wpstr "-----" wpstr A lit wpput
wpq @ wpx @ - ;
\ wpfind ( text key -- a | 0 )  just past the first key in the text.
: wpkey variable ;
: wpfind
wpkey !  0 lit wpv !
begin dup c@ wpv @ 0= and while
	dup wpkey @ dup strlen wssame if dup wpkey @ strlen + wpv ! then
	1 lit +
repeat drop wpv @ ;
\ wp64v ( c -- v | -1 )  a base64 character's value ('=' 0).
: wp64v
dup 41 lit - 1A lit u< if 41 lit - else dup 61 lit - 1A lit u< if 61 lit - 1A lit + else
dup 30 lit - A lit u< if 30 lit - 34 lit + else dup 2B lit = if drop 3E lit else
dup 2F lit = if drop 3F lit else 3D lit = if 0 lit else FFFFFFFF lit then then then then then then ;
\ wpdec ( a dst -- n | -1 )  base64 from a up to the next '-' (whitespace
\ passed over) into dst.
: wpdn variable ;  : wpcnt variable ;  : wppad variable ;  : wpbad variable ;
: wpdec
wpx !  0 lit wpdn !  0 lit wpv !  0 lit wpcnt !  0 lit wppad !  0 lit wpbad !
begin dup c@ dup 0= 0= swap 2D lit <> and while
	dup c@ 20 lit u> if
		dup c@ 3D lit = if wppad @ 1 lit + wppad ! then
		dup c@ wp64v dup 0< if 2drop 1 lit wpbad !  "" else
			wpv @ 6 lit lshift or wpv !  wpcnt @ 1 lit + wpcnt !
			wpcnt @ 4 lit = if
				wpv @ 10 lit rshift wpx @ wpdn @ + c!  wpv @ 8 lit rshift wpx @ wpdn @ + 1 lit + c!  wpv @ wpx @ wpdn @ + 2 lit + c!
				wpdn @ 3 lit + wppad @ - wpdn !  0 lit wpcnt !  0 lit wpv !  0 lit wppad !
			then
			1 lit +
		then
	else 1 lit + then
repeat
c@ 2D lit =  wpbad @ 0= and  wpcnt @ 0= and if wpdn @ else FFFFFFFF lit then ;
: wpfrom
wpx !  wpq !
wpq @ "-----BEGIN TAB PAYMENT PROOF-----" wpfind ?dup if wpx @ wpdec  1 lit wpz ! else
	wpq @ "-----BEGIN TAB BURN PROOF-----" wpfind ?dup if wpx @ wpdec  2 lit wpz ! else FFFFFFFF lit 0 lit wpz ! then
then
dup 0< 0= if dup 0= if drop FFFFFFFF lit else wpx @ c@ wpz @ <> if drop FFFFFFFF lit then then then ;
